 r←Test_AskNumber_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "AskForNumber" method with defaults parameters only.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'How many copies?'

 n←myGuiParms parms(#._APLGUI.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 n.Input ∆KeyPress'33'
 ⎕NQ n.Input 9995
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕NQ n.Btn0'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →FailsIf 33≢n.∆result

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
